# Keeper Tala and the beacon tool locker on Beacon Saddle (CIPlay beacon_saddle_talk, 11-12 w08; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe: Tala sitting by the path up from the landing at -1.5 -30; the tool locker (bslocker) at the
# foot of the beacon tower at 3.5 -1 on the saddle (4 m). The locker refuses before anyone talked to her; her three
# answers (journal, a battery, goodbye); then the locker opens.
island Beacon Saddle keep
offset -0.2055 -0.0675
hour 11
weather Calm

# The tool locker: padlocked before anyone talked to Tala
open Beacon tool locker
expect message padlocked

# Keeper Tala by the path
snap bs_islander Keeper Tala 0 3.5 0.6
use Keeper Tala pick 1
expect message Past this, nothing on the charts
use Keeper Tala pick 2
expect message keeper's last spare
expect item Battery 1
use Keeper Tala pick 3
expect message Mind the breakwater

# Now the locker opens
open Beacon tool locker
wait 2
expect item Bolt 3
expect item MetalIngot 2
picture bs_tala 3 6 -36 -1.5 5 -30
